          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Patient room recliner</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker’s stylish patient room recliner maximizes patient and guest comfort, while providing uncompromised durability. Choose from rocker or wall-saver models, with open or upholstered arms available on each model.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Rocker or wall-saver models available<br>\n </span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Extended, wide arm caps<br>\n </span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Pull-out foot tray provides added comfort</span><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
