          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 28 2020 17:00:49 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Treatment Recliner</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The Stryker Treatment Recliner features an infinite number of recline positions, which helps promote recovery by getting patients out of bed sooner. A tray table and IV pole are available as options.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Trendelenburg position</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Backrest locks into infinite number of recline positions<br>\n </span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Extended, wide arm caps</span><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
